  "title": "Answer: experience is basic, made of psychons, and known by privileged access",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "553290be-2c1c-4ec4-b33b-b662bbd6038c",
      "text": "Experience is basic: mental events are not brain events, and the mental world is composed of psychons, each carrying its own characteristic experience. The subject knows experience in a way no observer can, by having it.",
